      "review_state": "mechanically_checked",
      "slice_ids": [
        "slc_7d8c0a1a3432633b2fe2893f16186a5eb9d671251e38d7901e1e166611e7a3f2"
      ],
      "text": "The pipeline flows from task YAML plus repository policy through queueing, daemon claim, isolated git worktree execution, supervisor review, then acceptance (PR or local completion), retry within budget, or failure for human review."
